(7679000, 1254931, 181505, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the shot is absolutely amazing without focus stacking!! You deserve the blue just for that amazing accomplishment!!</td>', 'The sharpness of the shot is absolutely amazing without focus stacking!! You deserve the blue just for that amazing accomplishment!!', '2020-11-08 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679027, 1254931, 112739, '<td valign="top">Man, I saw this image and said to myself, this one will be way up there. And it is! Ants are harder to photograph than just about anything, they are always moving. So huge congrats on not only a highly technically appealing image, but one that settles in as a real genuine work as the details of the daily lives of ants carry on. Congrats on the Blue!</td>', 'Man, I saw this image and said to myself, this one will be way up there. And it is! Ants are harder to photograph than just about anything, they are always moving. So huge congrats on not only a highly technically appealing image, but one that settles in as a real genuine work as the details of the daily lives of ants carry on. Congrats on the Blue!', '2020-11-08 10:30:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679036, 1254931, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue Roz. Lovely image and one of my highest scores in voting. Could only score well and great detail, sharpness, light in an incredibly difficult genre of photography - at least for me, You make it look so easy. well done</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue Roz. Lovely image and one of my highest scores in voting. Could only score well and great detail, sharpness, light in an incredibly difficult genre of photography - at least for me, You make it look so easy. well done', '2020-11-08 11:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679037, 1255847, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the yellow Wendy. I used to think this kind of photography is easy enough untill I tried it myself recently. Skill certainly only comes with experience shooting birds. Well done</td>', 'Congrats on the yellow Wendy. I used to think this kind of photography is easy enough untill I tried it myself recently. Skill certainly only comes with experience shooting birds. Well done', '2020-11-08 11:53:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679039, 1255142, 86218, '<td valign="top">Im surprised this did not Ribbon. Of course being a landscape Im biased. My shot is so much simpler than a piece of work like this. Enjoyed this image very much in voting. Great work</td>', 'Im surprised this did not Ribbon. Of course being a landscape Im biased. My shot is so much simpler than a piece of work like this. Enjoyed this image very much in voting. Great work', '2020-11-08 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679040, 1255478, 86218, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image. Loved this. Should have done better</td>', 'Fantastic image. Loved this. Should have done better', '2020-11-08 11:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679041, 1255625, 86218, '<td valign="top">Masterful. There is an eye behind this image which combined compositional elements to perfection. Shapes, tones, and processing makes the special look spectacular here. Great work Dennis</td>', 'Masterful. There is an eye behind this image which combined compositional elements to perfection. Shapes, tones, and processing makes the special look spectacular here. Great work Dennis', '2020-11-08 12:00:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679043, 1255852, 91360, '<td valign="top">great portrait! was in my top 5</td>', 'great portrait! was in my top 5', '2020-11-08 12:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679044, 1255808, 112739, '<td valign="top">Darn Rian, you make me want to get my long lenses out of the closet and start using them again. Excellent wildlife image! Congrats on the Red!</td>', 'Darn Rian, you make me want to get my long lenses out of the closet and start using them again. Excellent wildlife image! Congrats on the Red!', '2020-11-08 13:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679045, 1255142, 112739, '<td valign="top">Let''s see...Star trails, water, city lights, Hawaiian shoreline. Top 5! Congrats Mark on HM! No catching you now in the FSM.</td>', 'Let''s see...Star trails, water, city lights, Hawaiian shoreline. Top 5! Congrats Mark on HM! No catching you now in the FSM.', '2020-11-08 13:35:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679046, 1255298, 112739, '<td valign="top">Congrats Jake! Lots of great images this month. Happy to see your wildlife images have been consistently successful! I like the color contrasts in the image.</td>', 'Congrats Jake! Lots of great images this month. Happy to see your wildlife images have been consistently successful! I like the color contrasts in the image.', '2020-11-08 13:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679047, 1255478, 112739, '<td valign="top">I agree with all the rest of the comments, this tree is phenomenal. Trees are always so hard to compose though too. Its like you have to sit there and study and study will you feel something works. Congrats on TT with your wonderful work here!</td>', 'I agree with all the rest of the comments, this tree is phenomenal. Trees are always so hard to compose though too. Its like you have to sit there and study and study will you feel something works. Congrats on TT with your wonderful work here!', '2020-11-08 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679049, 1255597, 112739, '<td valign="top">The still life Queen! Always such a pleasure to view and experience.</td>', 'The still life Queen! Always such a pleasure to view and experience.', '2020-11-08 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679050, 1255876, 68504, '<td valign="top">I kept the tilt in the horizon on purpose, as it seemed to emphasize the stillness of the central figure, and possibly the sense of time falling away. (One of my personal favourites, a call but no response).</td>', 'I kept the tilt in the horizon on purpose, as it seemed to emphasize the stillness of the central figure, and possibly the sense of time falling away. (One of my personal favourites, a call but no response).', '2020-11-08 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679057, 1255142, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful as usual Mark.  Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful as usual Mark.  Congrats!', '2020-11-08 21:05:28.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7679058, 1255298, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful Jake, so sharp and clean.  I have never seen a squirrel eat an apple.</td>', 'This is wonderful Jake, so sharp and clean.  I have never seen a squirrel eat an apple.', '2020-11-08 21:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679059, 1255478, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and photographed so well.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and photographed so well.', '2020-11-08 21:07:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679060, 1255625, 109227, '<td valign="top">I admired this during voting.  The bw tones and contrast are perfect.</td>', 'I admired this during voting.  The bw tones and contrast are perfect.', '2020-11-08 21:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679085, 1255142, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> Let''s see...Star trails, water, city lights, Hawaiian shoreline. Top 5! Congrats Mark on HM! No catching you now in the FSM. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m not sure if I''m going to be able to get anything in November.  Two days after I shot this I tore a tendon in one of my quads while surfing.  Been on the mend ever since and just not sure if I''ll be able to get out to shoot for a while.  We''ll see I guess.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Dennisheckman: Let''s see...Star trails, water, city lights, Hawaiian shoreline. Top 5! Congrats Mark on HM! No catching you now in the FSM.   I''m not sure if I''m going to be able to get anything in November.  Two days after I shot this I tore a tendon in one of my quads while surfing.  Been on the mend ever since and just not sure if I''ll be able to get out to shoot for a while.  We''ll see I guess.', '2020-11-09 01:45:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679123, 1255675, 50695, '<td valign="top">interesting photo. I love the incense in the foreground. As to the plastic container and cell phone, I think we have to accept the world we are living in.</td>', 'interesting photo. I love the incense in the foreground. As to the plastic container and cell phone, I think we have to accept the world we are living in.', '2020-11-09 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679124, 1255656, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, what a glorious photograph. Well done. I''m going to give this an almost blue so people can see it that way.<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077283" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077283.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077283.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077283.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-11-09 11:17:37.</i></td>', 'wow, what a glorious photograph. Well done. I''m going to give this an almost blue so people can see it that way. ', '2020-11-09 11:17:19.000000', '2020-11-09 11:17:37.000000', 0),
(7679125, 1255707, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what standards the commentor is using. Maybe the standard of wanting to see the subject clearly, which is irrelevant to what you are doing. I think this is lovely and you should continue experimenting with light and form. Well done.</td>', 'I don''t know what standards the commentor is using. Maybe the standard of wanting to see the subject clearly, which is irrelevant to what you are doing. I think this is lovely and you should continue experimenting with light and form. Well done.', '2020-11-09 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679127, 1255816, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the editing choices you made. I think you captured the chaos of the moment.</td>', 'I like the shot and the editing choices you made. I think you captured the chaos of the moment.', '2020-11-09 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679128, 1255877, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful jumble</td>', 'this is a beautiful jumble', '2020-11-09 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679129, 1255790, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice use of the drone!</td>', 'nice use of the drone!', '2020-11-09 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679130, 1255757, 50695, '<td valign="top">that little touch of color, the composition, exquisite.<br/> <br/>I''m giving this an Almost Blue<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077283" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077283.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077283.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077283.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'that little touch of color, the composition, exquisite. I''m giving this an Almost Blue ', '2020-11-09 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
