(7679134, 1255821, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GinaRothfels:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> Seems overexposed, with the bird loosing color and detail. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nik free version has always been a part of my processing and it''s not working with the latest Photoshop update. I think it would have helped. Regardless I should have stayed in my comfort zone and entered the black and white version.<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1256075" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1256075.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1256075.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1256075.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a> </i></td></tr></table>I personally strongly prefer the color version. the black and white loses the intensity of the light.</td>', 'Originally posted by GinaRothfels: Originally posted by willem: Seems overexposed, with the bird loosing color and detail.   Nik free version has always been a part of my processing and it''s not working with the latest Photoshop update. I think it would have helped. Regardless I should have stayed in my comfort zone and entered the black and white version.  I personally strongly prefer the color version. the black and white loses the intensity of the light.', '2020-11-09 11:34:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679135, 1255876, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like your title. It''s redundant but in that redundancy I take a breath. I like sitting in the darkness waiting for the world to straighten out.</td>', 'I like your title. It''s redundant but in that redundancy I take a breath. I like sitting in the darkness waiting for the world to straighten out.', '2020-11-09 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679136, 1255880, 50695, '<td valign="top">i love the colors. peaceful but also bright<br/></td>', 'i love the colors. peaceful but also bright', '2020-11-09 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679137, 1255799, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave you some serious competition but you outdid me. Congratulations. I actually think the light is gorgeous in this photo and I love how it camouflages your subject instead of revealing it.</td>', 'I gave you some serious competition but you outdid me. Congratulations. I actually think the light is gorgeous in this photo and I love how it camouflages your subject instead of revealing it.', '2020-11-09 11:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679202, 1255298, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM, Jake. It''s a wonderful image.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM, Jake. It''s a wonderful image.', '2020-11-10 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7679206, 1254931, 98565, '<td valign="top">This is mind-blowingly goooood.... awesome clarity, perfect composition and exposure.<br/>Congrats, Roz!!!</td>', 'This is mind-blowingly goooood.... awesome clarity, perfect composition and exposure.Congrats, Roz!!!', '2020-11-10 05:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
