(7679601, 1255802, 91360, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> i came to this one when i was commenting on this challenge during voting ... and was going to say how stunning this is .. how i''m loving everything about it .. particularly how the waves are coming from different directions .. and that sky .. and the light .. and the feeling of freedom ..  so beautiful .. <br/>but i got interrupted by my dog tod who had to go out .. then i had to go out as well .. in the car .. not the yard btw .. ;)<br/>so now i have come to see how this went after rollover as it made quite an impression .. and make the comment i didnt have time to make before ..  <br/>i felt when i first saw this that it would surely come in the top ten at least .. <br/>so congratulations on where it would have come in another reality .. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>WOW Roz, Thank you! as a big fan of your works I''m thrilled to read your comment!</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: i came to this one when i was commenting on this challenge during voting ... and was going to say how stunning this is .. how i''m loving everything about it .. particularly how the waves are coming from different directions .. and that sky .. and the light .. and the feeling of freedom ..  so beautiful .. but i got interrupted by my dog tod who had to go out .. then i had to go out as well .. in the car .. not the yard btw .. ;)so now i have come to see how this went after rollover as it made quite an impression .. and make the comment i didnt have time to make before ..  i felt when i first saw this that it would surely come in the top ten at least .. so congratulations on where it would have come in another reality .. ;)   WOW Roz, Thank you! as a big fan of your works I''m thrilled to read your comment!', '2020-11-17 14:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7714796, 1254931, 66597, '<td valign="top">Roz, I have many more images to take in from your portfolio, as its prolific and the images deserve time and attention. But, this one TOTALLY blew me away the moment I opened it. Literally, I said wow! The technical execution of those perfectly crisp, sharp ants, the composition, and beautiful shallow DOFand those colors! I took a look at your exposure settings and think I may be using slightly too shallow DOF when I shoot insects. Im going to take a book out of the master Roz playbook and try around an f/7. Just awesome!!!! xx</td>', 'Roz, I have many more images to take in from your portfolio, as its prolific and the images deserve time and attention. But, this one TOTALLY blew me away the moment I opened it. Literally, I said wow! The technical execution of those perfectly crisp, sharp ants, the composition, and beautiful shallow DOFand those colors! I took a look at your exposure settings and think I may be using slightly too shallow DOF when I shoot insects. Im going to take a book out of the master Roz playbook and try around an f/7. Just awesome!!!! xx', '2022-02-18 06:44:24.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
